# A repository of BUILT artifacts. Git must not touch a single byte.
#
# The Content-Security-Policy on every page carries a SHA-256 hash of the
# inline <style> Astro emitted (astro.config.mjs, experimental.csp). Rewrite
# one line ending in one HTML file and that hash stops matching its own
# stylesheet, the browser refuses the styles, and the page ships unstyled with
# nothing but a console error to show for it. core.autocrlf is true on this
# machine, so this is not hypothetical.
#
# -text disables all end-of-line conversion, in both directions.
* -text
